#: lib/filehistorywidget.cpp:513
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Help text"
msgid ""
"Filter the log.<ul><li>Use <code>\"a:\"</code> prefix to filter by author "
"name. For e.g., <b>a:john doe</b></li><li>Use <code>\"!a:\"</code> prefix to "
"exclude an author. For e.g., <b>!a:john doe</b></li><li>Use <code>\"since:"
"\"</code> prefix to show commits after the given date. The author date of "
"each commit will be checked. The date format is yyyy-MM-dd For e.g., "
"<b>since:2025-04-17</b></li><li>Use <code>\"until:\"</code> prefix to show "
"commits before the given date. The author date of each commit will be "
"checked. The date format is yyyy-MM-dd For e.g., <b>until:2025-04-17</b></"
"li><li>To filter messages, just type the search term. If multiple search "
"terms are given then messages matching all the search terms will be shown.</"
"li></ul>To trigger the filter, press the <b>Enter</b> key."
msgstr ""
"Filtrirajte dnevnik.<ul><li>Upotrebite prefiks <code>„a:“</code> za "
"filtriranje po imenu autora. Na primer, <b>a:john doe</b></li><li>Upotrebite "
"prefiks <code>„!a:“</code> da isključite autora. Na primer, <b>!a:john doe</"
"b></li><li>Upotrebite prefiks <code>„since:“</code> da prikažete predaje "
"posle datog datuma. Proverava se autorski datum svake predaje. Format datuma "
"je yyyy-MM-dd. Na primer, <b>since:2025-04-17</b></li><li>Upotrebite prefiks "
"<code>„until:“</code> da prikažete predaje pre datog datuma. Proverava se "
"autorski datum svake predaje. Format datuma je yyyy-MM-dd. Na primer, "
"<b>until:2025-04-17</b></li><li>Za filtriranje poruka samo unesite izraz za "
"pretragu. Ako unesete više izraza, biće prikazane poruke koje odgovaraju "
"svim izrazima.</li></ul>Filtriranje pokrećete pritiskom na taster <b>Enter</"
"b>."

